<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea awards regional cable television licences.</title>
<headline>S.Korea awards regional cable television licences.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea announced on Thursday the winners for 23 regional cable television licences.  </p>
<p>An additional licence was undecided, the Ministry of Information said in a statement.</p>
<p>The licence winners can start broadcasting in the second half of this year at the earliest.  </p>
<p>The following are listed companies that have won licences: Dong-A Pharmaceutical, Tae Kwang Industry, Trigem Computer, Dae Han Pulp, Seoul City Gas, Keyang Electric Machinery, Chefline, Saehan Industry, Han Mi Pharmaceutical Co Ltd, Songwon Industry Co Ltd, Hankuk Carbon, Shinmoorim Paper and Kyung Nam Energy.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
